    <node id="&quot;DEATH AT A FUNERAL (2007 FILM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Death at a Funeral (2007 film) is a 2007 British ensemble black comedy film directed by Frank Oz, focusing on a family's attempt to resolve various issues during their father's funeral."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0030-1c2e3be01e32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANK OZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Frank Oz is the director of the 2007 film 'Death at a Funeral', known for directing ensemble black comedy films."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0030-1c2e3be01e32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEAN CRAIG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dean Craig is the screenwriter of the 2007 film 'Death at a Funeral', responsible for the screenplay focusing on family dynamics during a funeral."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0030-1c2e3be01e32</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DANIEL&quot;">
